{
    "title": "Rapid VPN - Safe Secure Proxy",
    "description": "Rapid VPN is a fast, free, easy-to-use VPN service in your pocket! Enjoy a safe, secure, and anonymous internet connection from anywhere in the world. Protect your private data and broaden your access to regionally available content from around the globe.\r\n\r\nWe encrypt your Internet connection so that your online activity can\u2019t be tracked and your personal information is safe, especially when you using public free Wi-Fi or unsecured sites.\r\n\r\nOur global VPN network includes America, Europe, Asia, and more! Connect to any server of your choice and enjoy a layer of security for all of your internet activity and personal data, as well as access to streaming services and games not available in your region.\r\n\r\nWhy use Rapid VPN?\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Large number of servers, high-speed bandwidth\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Strict User Privacy Pledge - No logging, EVER\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Choose apps which using VPN (Android 5.0+ required)\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Works with Wi-Fi, 5G, LTE/4G, 3G and all mobile data carriers\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Smart server recommendations\r\n\ud83d\ude80 No usage and time limit\r\n\ud83d\ude80 No registration or configuration required\r\n\r\nOur User Privacy Pledge\r\nYour privacy is VERY important to us. Unlike other VPN services, we never keep a record of your internet activity or personal details. All information related to your activity while connected via Rapid VPN is encrypted and remains completely anonymous; we never see, store, or use any of your personal data. Maintaining your privacy, safety, and security are part of our mission to provide an excellent service!\r\n\r\nWhat is VPN?\r\nVPN stands for \u201cvirtual private network\u201d \u2014 a service that protects your internet connection and privacy online. It creates an encrypted tunnel for your data, protects your online identity by hiding your IP address, and allows you to use public Wi-Fi hotspots safely.\r\n\r\nWhy do I need VPN?\r\n\ud83c\udf10You use public Wi-Fi\r\nVPN is used to secure your connection on public Wi-Fi, so you can browse in full privacy. Hackers have many methods to steal your data on public hotspots, but with a VPN your online traffic is invisible to them.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0eYou want to access your content\r\nIf you want to access your home content while traveling around the world, a VPN can help. Use Rapid VPN on your device and never miss a friend\u2019s post on social media or the latest episode on top streaming services like Netflix, Hulu, and ESPN.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12You want to stay safe online\r\nGovernment agencies, marketers, internet service providers would all love to track and collect your browsing history, messages, and other private data. Best way to hide it? Using a VPN to encrypt your traffic, hide your IP, and cover your tracks online. Use it at home, at work, and on the go to enjoy non-stop protection.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaeYou\u2019re a gamer\r\nPeople who like gaming online unfortunately have to deal with DDoS attacks and bandwidth throttling as well. Luckily, you can forget about all of these problems with Rapid VPN!\r\n\r\nDownload the secure, fast and free Rapid VPN app now!\r\n\r\nTerms of Service & Privacy Policy\r\nBy downloading and/or using this product, you acknowledge and agree to the end user license agreement and Privacy Statement at https://rapidvpn.app/privacy\r\n\r\nOur 24/7 customer support team is always here to help you via Feedback in the app!",
